WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.675
The Kakeya needle problem.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.796
A needle in every direction, packed tight.

3
00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:06.791
Must the set fill all the space?

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.266
A worst overlap of tubes would force a rigid stack, which breaks.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.094
Claimed: full dimension in four, maximal in three.

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.750
No Lean proof.
